House Robber
=================
Solve karne ke liye muh se bolna shuru kardo , jo bologe wahi likhna hai solution

recursive code: class Solution {
    int maxAmount(int n,int[] nums)
    {
        if(n==0) return nums[0];
        if(n==1) return Math.max(nums[0],nums[1]);
        return Math.max(nums[n]+maxAmount(n-2,nums),maxAmount(n-1,nums));
    }
    public int rob(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length-1;
        return maxAmount(n,nums);
    }
}

T.C. : O(2^n)  depth n hai aur har level pe 2 hai
S.C. : O(n)  recursion stack ka

top-down mein piche se start karte hai

Top-down: class Solution {
    int maxAmount(int n,int[] nums,int[] dp)
    {
        if(n==0) return nums[0];
        if(n==1) return Math.max(nums[0],nums[1]);
        if(dp[n]!=-1) return dp[n];
        return dp[n] =  Math.max(nums[n]+maxAmount(n-2,nums,dp),maxAmount(n-1,nums,dp));
    }
    public int rob(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length-1;
        int[] dp = new int[n+1];
        Arrays.fill(dp,-1);
        return maxAmount(n,nums,dp);
    }
}

